# Coordinated Maneuver, first mode: with one Ornithopter on Bot1's side, only 1 damage is dealt to Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2), which
# survives with that damage marked, though Bot2 controls two creatures: it counts "creatures you control" (Bot1's), not the target's side.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Coordinated Maneuver
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Coordinated Maneuver.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Coordinated Maneuver deals damage)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 2
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1.Damage = 1
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
